    "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at trunk -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Toolchain and implementation changes :hammer_and_wrench:\n* Switch tests to use the rendered form of diagnostics by @chandlerc in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8070\n* Force inlining of `Hasher::HashSizedBytes` by @chandlerc in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8092\n* Update LLVM to c744694c6ae1 by @lnihlen in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8096\n* Add various access tests related to inheritance by @nicholasbishop in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8100\n* Handle references to global `let`s and enclosing locals. by @zygoloid in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8061\n### Infrastructure changes :building_construction:\n* Get Bazel and CI ready for updated `protobuf` and `rules_python` by @chandlerc in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8094\n* Clean up environment variables after deleting Android SDK by @chandlerc in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8099\n* Bump the bazel group across 1 directory with 13 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8082\n* Bump the github-actions-major group across 5 directories with 9 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8098\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/compare/v0.0.0-0.nightly.2026.11.05...v0.0.0-0.nightly.2026.11.06",
