    "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yaml at trunk -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Toolchain and implementation changes :hammer_and_wrench:\n* Remove semir dumps from class/access tests by @nicholasbishop in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8089\n### Infrastructure changes :building_construction:\n* Add support for direct-commit prek fixes for dependabot by @chandlerc in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8084\n* Bump the pre-commit group across 1 directory with 3 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8079\n### Other changes\n* Disable autoformatting in examples of weird formatting. by @zygoloid in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8090\n* Switch from `rumdl` disable to more general `fmt` annotations by @chandlerc in https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/pull/8091\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carbon-language/carbon-lang/compare/v0.0.0-0.nightly.2026.11.04...v0.0.0-0.nightly.2026.11.05",
